%% Activity — task processing flow
flowchart TD
    start([Start]) --> recv[Receive task + user_id]
    recv --> val{Valid & within<br/>length limit?}
    val -- No --> err[Return 4xx error] --> stop([End])
    val -- Yes --> plan[Planner: decompose into sub-tasks]
    plan --> pok{Plan parsed?}
    pok -- No --> repair[One repair retry] --> pok2{Parsed?}
    pok2 -- No --> fail[Fail cleanly] --> stop
    pok2 -- Yes --> level
    pok -- Yes --> level[Next dependency level]
    level --> research[Research sub-tasks in parallel]
    research --> more{More levels?}
    more -- Yes --> level
    more -- No --> aggregate[Aggregate findings]
    aggregate --> validate[Validator: rules + LLM judge]
    validate --> pass{Rules pass AND<br/>score >= threshold?}
    pass -- Yes --> done[Return final result] --> stop
    pass -- No --> retry{Retries left?}
    retry -- Yes --> level
    retry -- No --> partial[Return partial result + errors] --> stop
